<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
  </head>
  <body>
    <h2>Your Public Calendar Link Has Been Regenerated</h2>

    <p>Hello <%= @user.name || @user.email %>,</p>

    <p>
      Your public link for <strong><%= @calendar.name %></strong> has been successfully regenerated.
    </p>

    <h3>Important Information:</h3>

    <ul>
      <li>The old link is no longer valid</li>
      <li>Your new link expires on: <strong><%= @new_expires_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p %Z") %></strong></li>
      <li>Update any shared links with the new URL</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      <strong>New Public URL:</strong><br/>
      <code style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 8px; display: block; margin-top: 8px;">
        <%= @public_url %>
      </code>
    </p>

    <p>
      Share this link with anyone who needs to view your calendar availability or book appointments.
    </p>

    <hr/>

    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 12px;">
      This is an automated confirmation from Callab. If you did not request this change,
      please contact support immediately.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
